## . [dotnet] DotNet tools=dotnet,cmd,pwsh,sh
build                    Build          inferred high   safe        .          dotnet build :: Build the Shop solution
test                     Testing        inferred high   safe        .          dotnet test :: Run all Shop solution tests
restore                  Build          inferred medium safe        .          dotnet restore :: Restore NuGet packages
clean                    Build          inferred low    safe        .          dotnet clean :: Delete .NET build outputs
pack                     Release        inferred medium safe        .          dotnet pack :: Create NuGet packages
format                   Quality        inferred low    safe        .          dotnet format :: Format .NET source code
cmd:build                Build          inferred low    safe        hidden .          .\build.cmd :: Build wrapper for Windows
pwsh:build               Build          inferred medium safe        hidden .          pwsh ./build.ps1 :: Build and package the solution
publish-image            Release        inferred medium external    .          pwsh ./scripts/publish-image.ps1 :: Run scripts/publish-image.ps1
seed-db                  Database       inferred medium safe        .          ./scripts/seed-db.sh :: Seed the development database
## src/Api [Api] DotNet tools=dotnet
api                      Development    inferred high   safe        src/Api    dotnet run :: Start the .NET Api web app
api:watch                Development    inferred low    safe        src/Api    dotnet watch run :: Start Api with hot reload
api:build                Build          inferred high   safe        src/Api    dotnet build :: Build the Api project
api:publish              Release        inferred medium safe        src/Api    dotnet publish -c Release :: Publish Api for deployment
api:migrate              Database       inferred medium safe        src/Api    dotnet ef database update :: Apply EF Core migrations to the database
api:db:drop              Database       inferred low    destructive src/Api    dotnet ef database drop :: Drop the database with EF Core
## src/Core [Core] DotNet tools=dotnet
core:build               Build          inferred high   safe        src/Core   dotnet build :: Build the Core project
core:pack                Release        inferred medium safe        src/Core   dotnet pack :: Create the Core NuGet package
## src/Worker [Worker] DotNet tools=dotnet
worker                   Development    inferred high   safe        src/Worker dotnet run :: Run the .NET Worker worker
worker:build             Build          inferred high   safe        src/Worker dotnet build :: Build the Worker project
worker:publish           Release        inferred medium safe        src/Worker dotnet publish -c Release :: Publish Worker for deployment
## tests/Api.Tests [Api.Tests] DotNet tools=dotnet
api.tests:test           Testing        inferred high   safe        tests/Api.Tests dotnet test :: Run Api.Tests tests
